{
  "description": "ZIP 244 transparent signature digests for all six hash types on Paralock-built transactions (Paralock itself only signs SIGHASH_ALL). For a P2SH input the scriptPubKey hashed is the P2SH script, not the redeem script. scriptSigs are not committed, so the digest of a signed transaction equals that of its unsigned form. Any other hash type is invalid in v5 and must be rejected, not masked (invalidHashTypes, on input 0 of the first transaction).",
